WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.739
In tutorial 4.2, you'll find the
keywords worth winning for your business,

00:00:10.789 --> 00:00:13.698
grouped by topic, with
quick wins called out.

00:00:14.718 --> 00:00:18.988
First, in Run an analysis, click
Start on Keyword discovery.

00:00:19.038 --> 00:00:21.760
It's the tool for finding
what your buyers search for.

00:00:22.759 --> 00:00:25.184
Now say what you sell. Leave it empty,

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:28.095
and Alaventra uses your
website's own description.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:32.509
Then add who buys it, the
country and your goal,

00:00:32.559 --> 00:00:35.202
plus any business facts
that sharpen the search.

00:00:37.284 --> 00:00:39.354
Next, choose any follow-ups:

00:00:39.404 --> 00:00:42.654
a keyword report or a written
page for the best keyword,

00:00:42.704 --> 00:00:44.180
and a check of your website.

00:00:45.213 --> 00:00:48.761
Each one you add shows up in the
Summary, with the credits it adds.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:56.093
When it looks right, click Find keywords.
You can leave the page while it works.

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:02.159
Your keyword strategy opens with
the best keyword to start with,

00:01:02.209 --> 00:01:04.427
and how many keywords
were checked to find it.

00:01:06.209 --> 00:01:09.634
Priority keywords show how
hard each one is for your site,

00:01:09.684 --> 00:01:12.769
how often people search
for it, and a plan to rank.

00:01:14.209 --> 00:01:17.534
Quick wins are easy
keywords with real searches.

00:01:17.584 --> 00:01:21.409
And searches that share the same
results can be won with one page.

00:01:22.431 --> 00:01:26.846
The content plan puts your topics
in order: now, next and later.

00:01:26.896 --> 00:01:30.063
Write a page, or Rank for
this keyword, starts the work.

00:01:31.047 --> 00:01:35.847
You also see the questions people
ask, how often they ask AI assistants,

00:01:35.897 --> 00:01:37.902
and the keywords your competitors win.

00:01:39.068 --> 00:01:42.979
So you know which searches fit your
business, and which page to write first.

00:01:45.068 --> 00:01:49.173
So, describe what you sell, choose
any follow-ups, click Find keywords,

00:01:49.223 --> 00:01:50.552
and read your strategy.

00:01:52.068 --> 00:01:57.312
You've found your keywords. Next, get a
verdict on a keyword, in tutorial 4.3.
